Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:56:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! logging: structure shared HTTP listener and worker
 diagnostics

Remove terminal per-producer JSON field/type/message conversion assertions. Preserve every preceding real RPC, file, restart, rejection and privacy assertion; remove now-unused schema reader helpers/imports only. No production code or lasting logging framework tests changed. Source syntax/Ruff/diff checks only; functional test NOT_RUN.

Preserved behavior: Invalid public listener and proxy configuration fails startup.
---
 .../feature_logging_http_listeners.py         | 73 +------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 72 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_http_listeners.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_http_listeners.py
index f35abb9d93b3003fc9107dd9765280e0a155cdb3..21a2a4a31003223c7abaa16bbcbf177a5290701e 100644
--- a/test/functional/feature_logging_http_listeners.py
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_http_listeners.py
@@ -2,9 +2,7 @@
